<title>MEXICO: Eduardo Bours to lead Mexican business group, CCE.</title>
<headline>Eduardo Bours to lead Mexican business group, CCE.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Businessman Eduardo Bours Castelo will be the new president of the Business Coordinating Council (CCE), the council, Mexico's most important business group, said on Friday.</p>
<p>His term will run from 1997 to 1998.</p>
<p>He will take over from Hector Larios Santillan.</p>
<p>Bours, 41, is the president of Grupo Bachoco, an egg and chicken producer.</p>
<p>((--Veronica Galan, Mexico newsroom +525 728-9553))</p>
